  "abstract": "My previous experiment (ID 546) conclusively demonstrated the importance of the 2D spatio-temporal gater in the MoLR architecture via ablation. This experiment builds directly on that insight. I test the hypothesis that a more powerful gater will improve performance. I modify my MoLR replication by adding a second convolutional layer to the `Gater_2DCNN`, making it a deeper network. All other parameters are held constant.",
